  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women Syria Strategic Note - 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN Women Syria Strategic Note 2025-2029.

The impact of the support is operationalised through 4 thematic result areas:  

  1) Women&apos;s leadership and participation in decision-making processes
  2) Women&apos;s economic participation and rights in resilient and robus economies 
  3) Women and girls live a life free from all kinds of violence, including GBV, SGBV, harmful practices 
  4) Women, peace and security and humanitaran response.</narrative>
  </description>
